OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABeatles venue may not play live
OL,4,Amusic on rooftop
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Beatles famously stunned locals in
OL,7,FJanuary 1969 by playing a set on the
OL,8,Froof of the Grade II* listed building,
OL,9,Fwhich was Apple Corps' headquarters.
OL,11,FWestminster City councillors are due to
OL,12,Fvote on the plans on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
